msgid "Gately is an open-source, auditable network gateway toolkit (Lucky alternative) integrating DDNS, STUN, port forwarding, reverse proxy, ACME certificates, and WAF."
msgstr "Gately 是开源、可审计的网络网关工具集（Lucky 的开源替代），集成 DDNS、STUN 穿透、端口转发、反向代理、SSL 证书与 WAF 防火墙。"

