msgid "Admin password (at least 8 characters, default: admin123456). Modifying this and clicking Save & Apply will update the admin password immediately."
msgstr "管理员密码（至少 8 位字符，默认：admin123456）。修改此项并点击“保存并应用”将立即更新 admin 密码。"

